T="Same girl, same face, same blonde ponytail with blue ribbon, red bikini top, red mini skirt, brown gloves, brown belt with purple pouch, brown thigh-high boots, the two thin silver needles, same size and pixel art style, full body, no effects."
FV="STRICT straight front view, she faces the camera, symmetric, not turned to the side."
BV="STRICT straight back view, she faces away from the camera, we see her back and the red bikini back strap, never turned to the side."
e(){ python3 edit_pose.py "$1" "$2" "$3" "$4" 5 & }
e b_s.png k_cast_s_x.png csx "$FV $T Both hands raised in front of her chest holding the two long thin needle-rapiers crossed in an X pointing up, elbows bent, feet together, about to wind thread."
e b_s.png k_cast_s_t.png cst "$FV $T Throwing pose toward the camera: one arm thrust straight forward toward the viewer at chest height releasing a needle, the other arm pulled back holding the second rapier, feet apart, knees slightly bent, leaning slightly forward."
e b_n.png k_cast_n_x.png cnx "$BV $T Both hands raised in front of her chest (hidden by her body, elbows visible) holding the two long thin needle-rapiers crossed in an X pointing up above her shoulders, feet together, about to wind thread."
e b_n.png k_cast_n_t.png cnt "$BV $T Throwing pose away from the camera: one arm thrust straight forward away from the viewer releasing a needle, the other arm pulled back toward the camera holding the second rapier, feet apart, knees slightly bent."
e b_s.png k_jump_s.png js "$FV $T Jumping high in the air: both knees tucked up, feet together off the ground, arms close to her body holding the needles down, ponytail flying up."
e b_n.png k_jump_n.png jn "$BV $T Jumping high in the air: both knees tucked up, feet together off the ground, arms close to her body holding the needles down, ponytail flying up."
e b_s.png k_hurt_s.png hs "$FV $T Getting hit: she flinches, upper body jerks backward, head tilted back wincing with eyes shut, arms flung slightly out, knees bent."
e b_n.png k_hurt_n.png hn "$BV $T Getting hit: she flinches, upper body jerks backward toward the camera, head tilted back, arms flung slightly out, knees bent."
e b_s.png k_death_s.png ds "$FV $T Defeated: she has collapsed onto the ground and lies flat on her side, eyes closed, needles dropped beside her."
e b_n.png k_death_n.png dn "$BV $T Defeated: she has collapsed onto the ground and lies flat face down, needles dropped beside her."
e r_s.png k_rj_s.png rjs "$FV $T Running leap toward the camera in mid-air: one knee driven high forward, the other leg trailing back, both feet off the ground, arms pumping, ponytail flying back."
e r_n.png k_rj_n.png rjn "$BV $T Running leap away from the camera in mid-air: one knee driven high forward, the other leg trailing back, both feet off the ground, arms pumping, ponytail flying back."
e r_d.png k_rj_d.png rjd "Three-quarter front view facing down-right, same facing direction. $T Running leap in mid-air: front leg extended forward, back leg trailing behind, both feet off the ground, body leaning forward, arms pumping, ponytail flying back."
e r_u.png k_rj_u.png rju "STRICT three-quarter BACK view facing up-right, her face is never visible, never turns to a side view. $T Running leap in mid-air: front leg extended forward, back leg trailing behind, both feet off the ground, body leaning forward, arms pumping, ponytail flying back."
e b_d.png k_face_d.png fd "Three-quarter front view facing down-right, exactly the same pose and position. $T Only fix the face: clearly visible big blue eyes with a white highlight and dark lashes, small nose, small mouth, clean face without dark smudges. Do not change anything else."
wait
